    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939310/extras/62aaaafd548e66325292f89a4b3f18fc.poster.avif?t=1716940350\" width=400 height=157 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939310/extras/62aaaafd548e66325292f89a4b3f18fc.webm?t=1716940350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Welcome to RadioWorld! A fun, amazing attraction filled with robotics equipped with the latest top of the line artificial intelligence and robust systems put in place for all ages to come and enjoy... or at least that's what RadioWorld was before the incident...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939310/extras/b5a63a3445ae28830e305d49c93e39a4.poster.avif?t=1716940350\" width=750 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939310/extras/b5a63a3445ae28830e305d49c93e39a4.webm?t=1716940350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939310/extras/b5a63a3445ae28830e305d49c93e39a4.mp4?t=1716940350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You play as detective Robbie, going into RadioWorld to solve the mystery of the robotics attraction sudden cancellation and your misson? Find the hacker who was responsible for the incident at RadioWorld, and return safe.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939310/extras/46d5ebda3507550d3edc5d5633e800d1.poster.avif?t=1716940350\" width=750 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939310/extras/46d5ebda3507550d3edc5d5633e800d1.webm?t=1716940350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939310/extras/46d5ebda3507550d3edc5d5633e800d1.mp4?t=1716940350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>However it won't be so easy. The star of the show, RadioWave is always watching and waiting for the perfect chance to kill you as instructed. Do you have what it takes to survive?",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939310/extras/62aaaafd548e66325292f89a4b3f18fc.poster.avif?t=1716940350\" width=400 height=157 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939310/extras/62aaaafd548e66325292f89a4b3f18fc.webm?t=1716940350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Welcome to RadioWorld! A fun, amazing attraction filled with robotics equipped with the latest top of the line artificial intelligence and robust systems put in place for all ages to come and enjoy... or at least that's what RadioWorld was before the incident...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939310/extras/b5a63a3445ae28830e305d49c93e39a4.poster.avif?t=1716940350\" width=750 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939310/extras/b5a63a3445ae28830e305d49c93e39a4.webm?t=1716940350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939310/extras/b5a63a3445ae28830e305d49c93e39a4.mp4?t=1716940350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You play as detective Robbie, going into RadioWorld to solve the mystery of the robotics attraction sudden cancellation and your misson? Find the hacker who was responsible for the incident at RadioWorld, and return safe.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939310/extras/46d5ebda3507550d3edc5d5633e800d1.poster.avif?t=1716940350\" width=750 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939310/extras/46d5ebda3507550d3edc5d5633e800d1.webm?t=1716940350\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2939310/extras/46d5ebda3507550d3edc5d5633e800d1.mp4?t=1716940350\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>However it won't be so easy. The star of the show, RadioWave is always watching and waiting for the perfect chance to kill you as instructed. Do you have what it takes to survive?",
